IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sca-nouns`
IMPORT `sca-p1-preliminary`
IMPORT `sca-p4-civil-district`
IMPORT `sca-p4-magistrates-criminal`
IMPORT `sca-p4-transfers`

-- Tests for Part 4, ss 50 to 54G.  Every expected value is written from the text beside the assertion, never from the code's output.
-- The Magistrate's Court limit is $60,000 (s 2); the District Court limit is $250,000 (s 2).

-- Fixtures for a civil action; fields as in the p4a tests.
GIVEN personam IS A BOOLEAN, served IS A BOOLEAN, abroad IS A BOOLEAN, submits IS A BOOLEAN, money IS A BOOLEAN, amount IS A NUMBER, value IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Civil action`
`an action` MEANS `Civil action` OF personam, served, abroad, submits, money, amount, value, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

-- `an action with the flags`: money claim, passing off, supervisory, vested, 28A, abandoned, agreed, amount.
GIVEN money IS A BOOLEAN, passing IS A BOOLEAN, supervisory IS A BOOLEAN, vested IS A BOOLEAN, section28A IS A BOOLEAN, abandoned IS A BOOLEAN, agreed IS A BOOLEAN, amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Civil action`
`a served action with the flags` MEANS `Civil action` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, money, amount, 0, passing, supervisory, FALSE, vested, FALSE, section28A, abandoned, agreed

§ `Sections 50 and 51`

#ASSERT `s 50(1)(a) a District Court exercising criminal jurisdiction has the jurisdiction or power` `District Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 50(1)(a) a District Court exercising criminal jurisdiction has the jurisdiction or power` `District Court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 50(1)(a) a District Court exercising criminal jurisdiction has the jurisdiction or power` `District Court` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 50(1)(a) a District Court exercising criminal jurisdiction has the jurisdiction or power` `Magistrate's Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 50(1)(b) a District Court has the power to order the medical examination of the accused` `District Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 50(1)(b) a District Court has the power to order the medical examination of the accused` `District Court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 50(1)(b) a District Court has the power to order the medical examination of the accused` `Magistrate's Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 50(1)(b) a District Court has the power to order the medical examination of the accused` `District Court` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 50(2) / s 51(2): within Singapore; on a Singapore ship or aircraft; by a citizen on the high seas or an aircraft; a written law provides.
#ASSERT `s 50(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a District Court is exercisable over the offence` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 50(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a District Court is exercisable over the offence` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 50(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a District Court is exercisable over the offence` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 50(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a District Court is exercisable over the offence` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 50(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a District Court is exercisable over the offence` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 51(1)(a) a Magistrate's Court exercising criminal jurisdiction has the jurisdiction or power` `Magistrate's Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 51(1)(a) a Magistrate's Court exercising criminal jurisdiction has the jurisdiction or power` `District Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 51(1)(a) a Magistrate's Court exercising criminal jurisdiction has the jurisdiction or power` `Magistrate's Court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 51(1)(b) a Magistrate's Court has the power to order the medical examination of the accused` `Magistrate's Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 51(1)(b) a Magistrate's Court has the power to order the medical examination of the accused` `Magistrate's Court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 51(1)(b) a Magistrate's Court has the power to order the medical examination of the accused` `District Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 51(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a Magistrate's Court is exercisable over the offence` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 51(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a Magistrate's Court is exercisable over the offence` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 51(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a Magistrate's Court is exercisable over the offence` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 51(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a Magistrate's Court is exercisable over the offence` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 51(2) the criminal jurisdiction of a Magistrate's Court is exercisable over the offence` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 52`

-- s 52(1): same three routes as s 19(2); in personam only.
#ASSERT `s 52(1) a Magistrate's Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1) a Magistrate's Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1) a Magistrate's Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1) a Magistrate's Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 52(1) a Magistrate's Court has the jurisdiction of the General Division of the High Court to hear and try the action` (`an action` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 1_000 0) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 52(1A): the limit is $60,000; at the limit is not over.
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) the amount claimed or the value of the subject matter of the remedy or relief exceeds the Magistrate's Court limit` (`an action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 60_000 0) 60_000 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) the amount claimed or the value of the subject matter of the remedy or relief exceeds the Magistrate's Court limit` (`an action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 60_001 0) 60_000 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) the amount claimed or the value of the subject matter of the remedy or relief exceeds the Magistrate's Court limit` (`an action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE 100 60_001) 60_000 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) the action falls within a class that subsection (1A) excludes from a Magistrate's Court's jurisdiction` (`an action` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100 0) 60_000 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) the action falls within a class that subsection (1A) excludes from a Magistrate's Court's jurisdiction` (`a served action with the flags` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) 60_000 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) the action falls within a class that subsection (1A) excludes from a Magistrate's Court's jurisdiction` (`a served action with the flags` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) 60_000 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) a Magistrate's Court's jurisdiction under subsection (1) includes the action` (`a served action with the flags` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 60_001) 60_000 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) a Magistrate's Court's jurisdiction under subsection (1) includes the action` (`a served action with the flags` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 60_000) 60_000 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) a Magistrate's Court's jurisdiction under subsection (1) includes the action` (`a served action with the flags` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) 60_000 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 52(1A) a Magistrate's Court's jurisdiction under subsection (1) includes the action` (`a served action with the flags` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) 60_000 EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 52(1B): powers.
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Grant any relief, redress or remedy, or combination of remedies, absolute or conditional` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Give effect to every ground of defence or counterclaim, equitable or legal` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Grant an injunction` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Make a binding declaration of rights` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Order the medical examination of a party` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Order the medical examination of a party` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Make an order or exercise an authority which a Judge in chambers in the General Division of the High Court could make or exercise` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Exercise a power that section 43 or 49A gives a District Court` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Exercise a power that section 12 of the Civil Law Act 1909 gives a District Court` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` TRUE `Another power` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 52(1B) the Magistrate's Court has the power in the proceedings` FALSE `Grant an injunction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 52(2) a Magistrate's Court is subject to the limitation or provision in exercising its jurisdiction or powers` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52(2) a Magistrate's Court is subject to the limitation or provision in exercising its jurisdiction or powers` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The combined answer.  Flags: money claim, passing off, supervisory, vested, 28A, abandoned, agreed, amount.
#ASSERT `s 52 a Magistrate's Court has jurisdiction over the action` (`a served action with the flags` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 60_000) 60_000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 52 a Magistrate's Court has jurisdiction over the action` (`a served action with the flags` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) 60_000 EQUALS JUST TRUE
