-- An order varying the limit to $100,000 (s 52(3)) changes the answer for a $80,000 action.
#ASSERT `s 52 a Magistrate's Court has jurisdiction over the action` (`a served action with the flags` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 80_000) 60_000 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 52 a Magistrate's Court has jurisdiction over the action` (`a served action with the flags` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 80_000) 100_000 EQUALS JUST TRUE

#ASSERT `s 54 the judgment or order has the same effect and is enforced in the same manner as if given by a District Court` `Magistrate's Court` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54 the judgment or order has the same effect and is enforced in the same manner as if given by a District Court` `Magistrate's Court` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54 the judgment or order has the same effect and is enforced in the same manner as if given by a District Court` `District Court` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54AA(1) an appeal can be brought against the decision of a Magistrate's Court exercising civil jurisdiction` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54AA(1) an appeal can be brought against the decision of a Magistrate's Court exercising civil jurisdiction` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54AA(1) an appeal can be brought against the decision of a Magistrate's Court exercising civil jurisdiction` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54AA(1) an appeal can be brought against the decision of a Magistrate's Court exercising civil jurisdiction` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54AA(1) the bar on an appeal applies to the decision` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54AA(1) the bar on an appeal applies to the decision` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54AA(1) the bar on an appeal applies to the decision` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54AA(2) an agreement mentioned in subsection (1) may be made at that time` `Before the decision was made` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54AA(2) an agreement mentioned in subsection (1) may be made at that time` `After the decision was made` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54AA(2) an agreement mentioned in subsection (1) may be made at that time` `At another time` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54AA(2) the references in subsection (1) to a decision are references to that part of the decision` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54AA(2) the references in subsection (1) to a decision are references to that part of the decision` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Sections 54A to 54G`

#ASSERT `s 54A(1) a District Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to the District Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54A(1) a District Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to the District Court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54A(1) a District Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to the District Court` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54A(2) the order may be made on such terms as the court sees fit` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54A(2) the order may be made on such terms as the court sees fit` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54B(1) the General Division of the High Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to it` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54B(1) the General Division of the High Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to it` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54B(2) the order may be made on such terms as the court sees fit` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54B(2) the order may be made on such terms as the court sees fit` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54B Explanation the intended enforcement overseas would ordinarily be sufficient reason for transferring the proceedings to the General Division of the High Court` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54B Explanation the intended enforcement overseas would ordinarily be sufficient reason for transferring the proceedings to the General Division of the High Court` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54C(1) a party may apply to the General Division of the High Court for an order that the proceedings be transferred to a State Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54C(1) a party may apply to the General Division of the High Court for an order that the proceedings be transferred to a State Court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54C(1) a party may apply to the General Division of the High Court for an order that the proceedings be transferred to a State Court` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54C(2) the General Division of the High Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to a State Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54C(2) the General Division of the High Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to a State Court` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54C(2) the General Division of the High Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to a State Court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54C(3) an order under subsection (2) may be made in respect of the proceedings` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54C(3) an order under subsection (2) may be made in respect of the proceedings` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54C Explanation the fact that the proceedings fall within the civil jurisdiction of the State Courts is by itself ordinarily sufficient reason for transferring the proceedings to the State Courts` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54C Explanation the fact that the proceedings fall within the civil jurisdiction of the State Courts is by itself ordinarily sufficient reason for transferring the proceedings to the State Courts` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54D(1) a party may apply to the District Court for an order that the proceedings be transferred to a Magistrate's Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54D(1) a party may apply to the District Court for an order that the proceedings be transferred to a Magistrate's Court` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54D(2) the District Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to a Magistrate's Court` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54D(2) the District Court may order the proceedings to be transferred to a Magistrate's Court` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54D(3) an order under subsection (2) may be made in respect of the proceedings` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54D(3) an order under subsection (2) may be made in respect of the proceedings` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 54E(1): pending in a State Court; the matter's value; the District Court limit; within the prescribed time.
#ASSERT `s 54E(1) a party may apply to the General Division of the High Court for a transfer of the proceedings or of the counterclaim` TRUE 250_001 250_000 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54E(1) a party may apply to the General Division of the High Court for a transfer of the proceedings or of the counterclaim` TRUE 250_000 250_000 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54E(1) a party may apply to the General Division of the High Court for a transfer of the proceedings or of the counterclaim` FALSE 300_000 250_000 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54E(1) a party may apply to the General Division of the High Court for a transfer of the proceedings or of the counterclaim` TRUE 300_000 250_000 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 54E(2): on application or own motion; thinks fit; which order.
#ASSERT `s 54E(2) the General Division of the High Court may make the order` TRUE TRUE `Transfer the whole proceedings to the higher court` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54E(2) the General Division of the High Court may make the order` TRUE TRUE `Try the whole proceedings in the lower court` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54E(2) the General Division of the High Court may make the order` TRUE TRUE `Transfer the counterclaim to the higher court and try the claim and defence in the lower court` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54E(2) the General Division of the High Court may make the order` TRUE TRUE `Another order` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54E(2) the General Division of the High Court may make the order` TRUE FALSE `Transfer the whole proceedings to the higher court` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 54E(2) the General Division of the High Court may make the order` FALSE TRUE `Transfer the whole proceedings to the higher court` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 54E(3): (c) order made; judgment for the claimant; HC otherwise ordered; transferred proceedings concluded.
#ASSERT `s 54E(3) enforcement on the judgment on the claim is stayed` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 54E(3) enforcement on the judgment on the claim is stayed` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54E(3) enforcement on the judgment on the claim is stayed` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54E(3) enforcement on the judgment on the claim is stayed` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 54E(3) enforcement on the judgment on the claim is stayed` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
